#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%2366
msgid "<html><head/><body><p>Float: overcapacity windows<br/>become floating windows.</p><p>Minimize (default): hide the selected<br/>window and restore it when a slot is free.</p><p>Relocation to other screens or<br/>desktops still runs first.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>浮动：超出容量的窗口<br/>变为浮动窗口。</p><p>最小化（默认）：隐藏所选窗口，<br/>并在有空闲槽位时恢复。</p><p>仍会先尝试移动到其他屏幕<br/>或虚拟桌面。</p></body></html>"

