#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23291
msgid "Window class configuration"
msgstr "窗口类配置"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23292
msgid "<html><head/><body><p>Overriding default parameters for the specified WindowClass. Format:</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">WindowClass</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">shortname=value,shortname=value...&lt;Enter&gt;</span></p><p>format with specified titlе, you can specify only part of the title by writing it in square brackets:</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">WindowClass</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Title</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">shortname=value,shortname=value...&lt;Enter&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">pin - </span>docked window with this flag will displace another if their positions are equal.</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">left,right,top,bottom</span> - you can use one them to explicitly set the initial position.</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">auto</span> - automatically makes a window docked. Krohnkite version &gt;=0.9.9.1</p><p>You can only write down the parameters you want to change. You can see the short name of the parameter if you hover over any default parameter above.</p><p>Examples:</p><p>1. if Elisa switches to dock it will have higher priority, top dock position and 10% of screen height </p><p>org.kde.elisa<span style=\" font-weight:700;\">:pin,top:hh=10</span></p><p>2. Conky automatic docking:     <span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;\">Conky</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;\">auto</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;\"/></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">3.With title specified: </span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">com.obsproject.Studio</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Scripts</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">auto,left</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">vw=50</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>为指定的 WindowClass 覆盖默认参数。格式：</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">WindowClass</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">shortname=value,shortname=value...&lt;Enter&gt;</span></p><p>指定标题的格式：可以用方括号只指定标题的一部分：</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">WindowClass</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Title</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">shortname=value,shortname=value...&lt;Enter&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">pin - </span>带有此标志的停靠窗口在位置相同时会挤开另一个窗口。</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">left,right,top,bottom</span> - 可以使用其中之一显式设置初始位置。</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">auto</span> - 自动将窗口设为停靠。Krohnkite 版本 &gt;=0.9.9.1</p><p>只需填写需要修改的参数。将鼠标悬停在上方任意默认参数上即可查看其短名称。</p><p>示例：</p><p>1. 如果 Elisa 切换为停靠，它将拥有更高优先级、顶部停靠位置和屏幕高度的 10% </p><p>org.kde.elisa<span style=\" font-weight:700;\">:pin,top:hh=10</span></p><p>2. Conky 自动停靠：     <span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;\">Conky</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;\">auto</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-weight:700;\"/></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">3. 指定标题：</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">com.obsproject.Studio</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Scripts</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">auto,left</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ff0000;\">:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">vw=50</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23293
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Overriding default parameters for every surface. Format: </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">OuputName:ActivityId:VirtualDesktopName:shortname=value,shortname=value... &lt;Enter&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">You can only write down parameters you want to change. You can see the short name of the parameter if you hover over any default parameter above.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Next example override three params on all surfaces with OutputName=HDMI-A-1 </span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">HDMI-A-1:::hh=80,vw=80,ha=left</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">this one, will override two params only for defined display, virtual desktop and activity</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">HDMI-A-1:99e10d31-e8f3-44aa-bbed-2a543f13fa54:Desktop 1:vg=5,va=2</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">为每个表面覆盖默认参数。格式：</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">OuputName:ActivityId:VirtualDesktopName:shortname=value,shortname=value... &lt;Enter&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">只需填写需要修改的参数。将鼠标悬停在上方任意默认参数上即可查看对应的短参数名。</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">以下示例在所有 OutputName 为 HDMI-A-1 的表面上覆盖三个参数：</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">HDMI-A-1:::hh=80,vw=80,ha=left</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">此示例仅针对指定的显示器、虚拟桌面和活动覆盖两个参数：</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">HDMI-A-1:99e10d31-e8f3-44aa-bbed-2a543f13fa54:Desktop 1:vg=5,va=2</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23294
msgid "Dragging settings"
msgstr "拖动设置"

