msgstr "浮动"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23308
msgid "The Sole Window properties"
msgstr "单窗口属性"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23309
msgid "No Borders"
msgstr "无边框"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23310
msgid "No Gaps"
msgstr "无间隙"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23311
msgid "Output Override"
msgstr "输出覆盖"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23312
msgid "<html><head/><body><p>Comma-separated list to override the default Sole Window properties parameters: OutputName:Width:Height:NoBorders:NoGaps. Width and Height in % and can be from 1 to 100, NoBorders and NoGaps can be 0 or 1. You can omit parameters for example <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">DP-1:50</span> means you override only width to 50% on <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">DP-1</span> monitor. </p><p>Note. If you enable the No Gap option, this means that width and height no longer matter.</p><p><br/>Two monitors example:<span style=\" font-weight:700;\"> DP-1:::1:1,DP-2:80:70</span></p><p>on<span style=\" font-weight:700;\"> DP-1 </span>no Borders nor Gaps, on DP-2: 80% Width and 70% Height</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>用于覆盖默认单窗口属性参数的逗号分隔列表：OutputName:Width:Height:NoBorders:NoGaps。Width 和 Height 为 1 到 100 的百分比，NoBorders 和 NoGaps 可为 0 或 1。可以省略参数，例如 <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">DP-1:50</span> 表示仅在 <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">DP-1</span> 显示器上将宽度覆盖为 50%。 </p><p>注意：如果启用 No Gap，宽度和高度将不再生效。</p><p><br/>双显示器示例：<span style=\" font-weight:700;\"> DP-1:::1:1,DP-2:80:70</span></p><p>在<span style=\" font-weight:700;\"> DP-1 </span>上无边框且无间隙，在 DP-2 上宽度 80%、高度 70%</p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23313
msgid "OutputName:Width:Height,NoBorders,NoGaps,..."
msgstr "OutputName:Width:Height,NoBorders,NoGaps,..."

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23314
msgid "Unfitted Windows"
msgstr "无法适配的窗口"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23315
msgid "If enable make all windows floating if the maximum size to small for tile"
msgstr "如果启用，当窗口的最大尺寸小于平铺尺寸时，将所有窗口设为浮动。"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23316
msgid "make floating if  max. size of window less than Tile size "
msgstr "如果窗口最大尺寸小于平铺尺寸，则设为浮动"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23317
msgid "If enable make all windows floating if they minimum size to large for tile"
msgstr "如果启用，当窗口的最小尺寸大于平铺尺寸时，将所有窗口设为浮动。"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23318
msgid "(Experimental)make floating if  min. size of window greater than Tile size "
msgstr "（实验性）如果窗口最小尺寸大于平铺尺寸，则设为浮动"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23319
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23320
msgid "<html><head/><body><p>Set the time (in milliseconds) for how long a pop-up notification will remain visible before it automatically disappears. A value of 0 will disable notifications.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>设置弹出通知在自动消失前保持可见的时长（毫秒）。值为 0 时将禁用通知。</p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23321
msgid " ms"
msgstr "毫秒"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23322
msgid "Duration  "
msgstr "持续时长"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23323
msgid "All tiled windows will have no borders. Borders will be added back if window become float."
msgstr "所有平铺窗口将失去边框。当窗口变为浮动时，边框将恢复。"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23324
msgid "Use separate layouts and window split ratios for each Activity"
msgstr "为每个活动使用单独的布局和窗口分割比例"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23325
msgid "Use separate layouts and window split ratios for each Desktop"
msgstr "为每个虚拟桌面使用单独的布局和窗口分割比例"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23326
msgid "Remove borders of tiled windows"
msgstr "移除平铺窗口的边框"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23327
msgid "Virtual Keyboard support"
msgstr "虚拟键盘支持"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23328
msgid "Always preserve the tiling status of a window upon dragging"
msgstr "在窗口拖拽期间始终维持平铺状态"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23329
msgid "Draw a translucent rectangle at the dock slot a dragged window will occupy when the drag is over."
msgstr "在停靠槽处绘制半透明矩形，表示拖动结束后窗口将占据的位置。"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23330
msgid "Show a preview rectangle when dragging a window over a dock slot"
msgstr "将窗口拖到停靠槽上方时显示预览矩形"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23331
msgid "Prevent windows from minimizing (experimental)"
msgstr "防止窗口最小化（实验性）"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23332
msgid "Prevent window from protruding from its screen"
msgstr "防止窗口超出屏幕"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23333
msgid "<html><head/><body><p>If enabled, all windows with property skipPager=true become floating. You can create KDE Window Rule and force  skipPager=true.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>如果启用，所有具有 skipPager=true 属性的窗口都会变为浮动。你可以创建 KDE 窗口规则并强制设置 skipPager=true。</p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23334
msgid "Make the window float if its property: skipPager=true (HACK)"
msgstr "如果窗口属性 skipPager=true，则使其浮动（HACK）"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23335
msgid "Log"
msgstr "日志"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23336
msgid "Use this option to debug the script or submit detailed bug report."
msgstr "使用此选项调试脚本或提交详细错误报告。"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23337
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23338
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">logs all windows that Krohnkite indexes and manages</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">记录 Krohnkite 索引和管理的所有窗口</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23339
msgid "Added new windows"
msgstr "添加新窗口"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23340
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">logs all windows that Krohnkite does not manage for many reasons: service, dialog, etc.</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">记录 Krohnkite 因服务、对话框等原因而不管理的所有窗口</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23341
msgid "Filtered new windows"
msgstr "已筛选的新窗口"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23342
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">logs all windows that Krohkite could manage if not for the filters in the configuration</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">记录 Krohnkite 本可管理、但被配置中的筛选器排除的所有窗口</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23343
msgid "Unmanaged new windows"
msgstr "未管理的新窗口"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23344
msgid "<html><head/><body><h4 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:medium; font-weight:700;\">Filtering log modules</span></h4><p>the group of the log modules checkbox enables the entire group of log modules at once and in order to include only certain modules there is a line-edit nearby. Examples:</p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\"><li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">1,4-</span> - enable only the first and from the fourth to the last module</li><li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">!1,4-6</span> - the exclamation mark at the beginning turns on the exclude mode, so this line will enable all modules except 1 and from 4 to 6. <span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">!</span> - the exclamation mark you can use only once in the beginning, to enable the exclude mode.</li></ul></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><h4 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:medium; font-weight:700;\">过滤日志模块</span></h4><p>日志模块分组复选框可一次启用整组日志模块；若只想包含特定模块，可使用旁边的行编辑框。示例：</p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\"><li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">1,4-</span> — 仅启用第 1 个以及第 4 个到最后一个模块</li><li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">!1,4-6</span> — 开头的感叹号启用排除模式，此行将启用除 1 和 4 到 6 之外的所有模块。<span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">!</span> — 感叹号只能在开头使用一次，以启用排除模式。</li></ul></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23345
msgid "filter log modules popup tooltip <<<hover me>>>"
msgstr "过滤日志模块弹出提示 <<<悬停我>>>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23346
msgid "<html><head/><body><h5 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">Workspace signals log modules</span></h5><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. screensChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. virtualScreenGeometryChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. currentActivityChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. currentDesktopChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. windowAdded</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. windowActivated</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">7. windowRemoved</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">8. surfaceChanged</span></p><p><br/></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><h5 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">工作区信号日志模块</span></h5><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. screensChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. virtualScreenGeometryChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. currentActivityChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. currentDesktopChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. windowAdded</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. windowActivated</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">7. windowRemoved</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">8. surfaceChanged</span></p><p><br/></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23347
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">All other log modules</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. shortcut</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. arrangeScreen</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. printConfig</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. setTimeout</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. window</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. dbus</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">所有其他日志模块</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. shortcut</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. arrangeScreen</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. printConfig</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. setTimeout</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. window</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. dbus</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23348
msgid "Workspace signals"
msgstr "工作区信号"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23349
msgid "Window signals     "
msgstr "窗口信号"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23350
msgid "<html><head/><body><h5 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">Window signals log modules</span></h5><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. activitiesChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. bufferGeometryChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. desktopsChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. fullScreenChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. interactiveMoveResizeStepped</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. maximizedAboutToChange</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">7. minimizedChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">8. moveResizedChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">9. outputChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">10. stackingOrderChanged</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><h5 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">窗口信号日志模块</span></h5><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. activitiesChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. bufferGeometryChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. desktopsChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. fullScreenChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. interactiveMoveResizeStepped</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. maximizedAboutToChange</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">7. minimizedChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">8. moveResizedChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">9. outputChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">10. stackingOrderChanged</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23351
msgid "Other                       "
msgstr "其他"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23352
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">Also, in addition to the fact that you can include only the modules you need, you can enable </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">Filter</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> checkbox and use other filters in filter line edit:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">winclass</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">Examples:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">winclass=[konsole]</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\"/><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">- some modules may be filtered by a window class, so this logs modules will show only windows with class that contains </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">konsole</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> word.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">!winclass=org.kde.elisa:org.kde.ruler</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> -Exclude Elisa and Kruler from log output</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">除了只包含所需模块外，你还可以启用 </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">筛选</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> 复选框，并在过滤器行编辑框中使用其他筛选条件：</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">winclass</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">示例：</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">winclass=[konsole]</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\"/><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> — 部分模块可以按窗口类筛选，因此这些日志模块只会显示类名包含 </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">konsole</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> 的窗口。</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">!winclass=org.kde.elisa:org.kde.ruler</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> — 从日志输出中排除 Elisa 和 Kruler</span></p></body></html>"

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%23353
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "筛选"
